OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies barbershop rape claims
OL,4,
OL,5,FA Kurdish man accused of raping a woman
OL,6,Fin a barbershop has told a court the
OL,7,Fpair had a "good relationship" and he
OL,8,Fhas denied sexually assaulting her.
OL,10,FJowad Haji, 24, is alleged to have
OL,11,Fwinked at the woman and made remarks
OL,12,Fabout her body before he attacked her
OL,13,Fin the back room of Barberia in
OL,14,FStratford-upon-Avon, Warwickshire, in
OL,15,FJanuary this year.
OL,17,FHe also told Warwick Crown Court he had
OL,18,Fnever offered the victim a job at his
OL,19,Fworkplace.
